cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, its code or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Automatic Slot Reel Tuning by Simulation: Genetic Algorithm vs Local Search"
abstract: >-
  A C++ slot-game simulator and a Python optimizer that tune slot reel strips to target
  RTP, hit rate and feature frequencies by simulation, with a 30-seed controlled experiment
  comparing nine genetic-algorithm configurations with hill climbing, simulated annealing
  and random search. Well-configured genetic algorithms and simulated annealing end in a
  statistical draw; the choice of settings matters more than the choice of method.
authors:
